Brand marks
-----------
assets/img/social/instagram.svg, x.svg and linkedin.png are the official
Instagram, X and LinkedIn marks, supplied by the program and used unaltered
except that linkedin.png is downscaled. They are trademarks of their owners.

The Weill Cornell Medicine, Rockefeller University and Memorial Sloan
Kettering logos (assets/img/logos/) belong to those institutions. The TPCB
wordmark and icon belong to the program.


Photographs and other images
----------------------------
The photographs in assets/img/photos/ and assets/img/news/ show people and
buildings of the TPCB community. Their rights are held by their owners and
have not been recorded here; do not reuse them on the strength of LICENSE.
The origin of assets/img/logos/headshot-placeholder.png is not recorded.
